  (text "Secondary leads are lettered on the sheet: blue 100 V line, white 16 ohm, yellow 8 ohm, orange common." (at 265.063 84.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "5453fbbf-50aa-5c96-9355-c96b567fe5cf"))
  (text "Feedback is taken from the 16 ohm tap." (at 265.063 88.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "1731adea-6962-5918-9658-d7ae9276084e"))
  (text "Power — universal-primary mains transformer (110/250 V, 50/60 c/s) and a centre-tapped HT winding; each arm rectified by three series silicon diodes; reservoir of three series 32 uF pairs;" (at 23.0632 186.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "b0a50f9f-72bb-502a-a553-64e2476f232c"))
  (text "a 20 H choke to the KT66 screen node, then 8.2 k and 10 k rail droppers. The mains lead carries a 2 A slow-blow fuse and the HT centre tap a 1 A slow-blow; a standby switch sits between" (at 23.0632 190.778 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "04773a58-10ca-5b0d-8552-c8a2d3bad1cc"))
  (text "the diode bank and the reservoir. Fuses, switch, mains transformer, heater winding and pilot lamp are omitted here — see the netlist." (at 23.0632 195.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left)) (uuid "7f268b44-3f72-54a8-9b8c-ef0f9e1569d6"))
